  "final_message": "Done. Built the store finder on the existing scaffold:\n\n- **Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite under `./data` \u2014 register/login with Bearer tokens, `GET /api/stores` (name sort; `q`/`lat`/`lng`/`radius` filtering with haversine `distance_km`, nearest first), `GET /api/stores/{id}`, admin-only create/replace/delete with `401`/`403` and field-level validation messages, PBKDF2 passwords, admin account from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` (sign-in disabled when unset), 8 seeded stores in London/Paris/Berlin/Amsterdam, plus `/api/health` and serving `frontend/dist`.\n- **Frontend** (React + TS + Vite + Tailwind v4): sign-in form, store list with search box, \"Use my location\" with radius selector and denial note, SVG lat/lng plot of listed stores + visitor, and admin add/edit forms showing API validation errors with confirmed delete.\n- Verified: `tsc --noEmit`, `vite build`, `npm ci` lock sync, and full API flows (auth, CRUD, radius search, persistence across restart) against gunicorn on port 8000.",
